.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH signstar-request-signature-prepare 1  "signstar-request-signature-prepare " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
signstar\-request\-signature\-prepare \- Prepare signing request for a file
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsignstar\-request\-signature prepare\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Prepare signing request for a file
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Increase logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Decrease logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
The path to a file being signed
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBSIGNSTAR_REQUEST_FILE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
